  "_comment": [
    "A SYNTHETIC college MIS export for the showcase learners. There is no real student,",
    "college or National ID here.",
    "",
    "It stands in for an already-digitised upstream system, which is what makes College the",
    "brownfield half of Iteration 4: the records are PULLED from here through the Authority",
    "Service, never typed into a portal. School, the greenfield half, is onboarded by CSV.",
    "",
    "The vocabulary is the MIS's own, not the registry's -- COMPUTER_ENGINEERING where the",
    "schema says COMPUTER_SCIENCE -- so the adapter's mapping table is exercised rather than",
    "bypassed. It also carries a fee ledger, a guardian phone number and an internal remark,",
    "none of which the adapter selects, so none of which reaches the registry or the",
    "credential.",
    "",
    "EDU-L-013001 has no row on purpose: that learner holds a School record and no College",
    "one, which is the partial-issuance fixture."
  ],
